  "description": "MCP server bridging AI assistants with openEHR design-time workflows. Exposes CKM archetype and template search, openEHR terminology concept resolution, curated guides and examples, and BMM type specifications as MCP resources via openehr:// URIs. Deployable locally via Docker or usable via hosted endpoint.",
