  "mach:judgementReason": "The first MCP server focused on openEHR design-time knowledge — CKM archetypes, templates, and terminology. Fills a genuine gap for AI agents working with openEHR artefacts. Pre-release (v0.x, breaking changes expected), maintained by Cadasto (small org, unclear long-term sustainability), and written in PHP which limits the contributor pool. Hosted endpoint available for quick evaluation. Track alongside the openEHR CDR-focused counterpart (deak-ai). Do not use in production clinical workflows until v1.0.",
